<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling unchanged vs dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling unchanged vs dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling was unchanged against the dollar, but weaker against the pound on Monday, the central Bank of Tanzania said.</p>
<p>The bank said the shilling exchanged at a commercial bank mean rate of 600.4053 against the dollar. Against the pound it was at a mean rate of 977.7315 compared to 974.2486 on Friday.</p>
</text>
